{"name":"Bleached Almond","hex":"#f3ead5","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bleached","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Whitened; made white using bleach","Faded or washed out by weather and strong sunlight."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of bleach"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bleached"},{"term":"almond","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The seed within the drupe of a small deciduous tree in family Rosaceae, Prunus amygdalus, considered a culinary nut.","The tree that produces almonds."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Brownish, resembling the colour of an almond nut."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/almond"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bleached","blocks":[{"text":"Bleached is an American pop band consisting of sisters Jennifer and Jessica Clavin, formerly of Mika Miko. The band plays a style of rock, pop, rock and roll, and indie rock. Bleached was established in Los Angeles in 2011. The group has released three studio albums, Ride Your Heart (2013), Welcome the Worms (2016) and Don't You Think You've Had Enough? (2019), all with Dead Oceans, and have charted on the Billboard charts."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Bleached_performing_at_The_Great_Escape%2C_May_2016.jpg/330px-Bleached_performing_at_The_Great_Escape%2C_May_2016.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleached","wikidata":"Q25056076"},{"title":"Almond","blocks":[{"text":"The almond is a species of tree from the genus Prunus. Along with the peach, it is classified in the subgenus Amygdalus, distinguished from the other subgenera by corrugations on the woody shell (endocarp) surrounding the seed."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Almonds_-_in_shell%2C_shell_cracked_open%2C_shelled%2C_blanched.jpg/330px-Almonds_-_in_shell%2C_shell_cracked_o